    "text": "<p>Match List-I with List-II.</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List-I<br />\t\t\t(Polymer)</strong></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List-II<br />\t\t\t(Monomer)</strong></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>A</td>\t\t\t<td>Neoprene</td>\t\t\t<td>I</td>\t\t\t<td>Acrylonitrile</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>B</td>\t\t\t<td>Teflon</td>\t\t\t<td>II</td>\t\t\t<td>Chloroprene</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>C</td>\t\t\t<td>Acrilan</td>\t\t\t<td>III</td>\t\t\t<td>Tetrafluoroethene</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>D</td>\t\t\t<td>Natural rubber</td>\t\t\t<td>IV</td>\t\t\t<td>Isoprene</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the option given<br />below:</p>",
